    "source": {
      "application": "Published literature example",
      "version": "Data Tool 2027 corpus 2026-09-21",
      "fileName": "eotwash-model-comparison.csv",
      "context": "Comparison study: Krishak & Desai, JCAP 07 (2020) 006, DOI 10.1088/1475-7516/2020/07/006. 87 residual torques, using the authors' public Data.txt unchanged. Companion CSV: eotwash-model-comparison.csv. Four candidate models; supplied per-row standard deviations. AIC is conditional on independent Gaussian errors and adequate candidate models; these assumptions are accepted for reproducing the calculation, not verified. The paper reports AICc, not AIC. Fixed phase and frequency region were selected after data inspection; model rankings do not establish new gravity. See the companion Markdown for discrepancies and numerical reference values."
    },
